  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> does not displace <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;from dilute acid because they are less reactive <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>SRP</mi><mo>&#8201;</mo><mi>value</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;</p><p>Given below are SRP values,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>|</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8277</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>Mn</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>|</mo><mi>Mn</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>185</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math></p>"
